      de: "Kokkedal liegt an der Ostküste Seelands.",
      hu: "Kokkedal Seeland keleti partján fekszik.",
      ro: "Kokkedal este situat pe coasta de est a Zeelandei.",
      en: "Kokkedal is located on the east coast of Zealand.",
